Name: search_fuzzy_always
Type: SWITCH
Default-Value: 0
Last-Modified: UNRELEASED

Whether to enable :rfc:`6203` FUZZY search for all IMAP SEARCH. If turned
on, search attributes will be searched using FUZZY search by default.  If
turned off, clients have to explicitly use the FUZZY search key to enable
fuzzy search for regular SEARCH commands.

This option, and the per-user ``search-fuzzy-always`` annotation that
overrides it, have no effect unless :imapdconf:`search_engine` is ``xapian``.
